## Deployment & Verification

Execute the following workflow from `/home/bob/terraform`:

```bash
# 1. Initialize provider plugins
terraform init

# 2. Format and validate configuration
terraform fmt
terraform validate

# 3. Provision infrastructure
terraform apply -auto-approve

# 4. Verify zero configuration drift
terraform plan
```

